{"articleNo":"85880","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=85880&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013 쿠웨이트 정부초청 아랍어 연수생 선발 홍보 요청","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.26","hit":"3517","attachments":[{"name":"2.쿠웨이트 아랍어연수생 지원서(본원 소정양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85880&attachNo=71597"},{"name":"5.쿠웨이트 정부어학지원자.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85880&attachNo=71598"},{"name":"3.Application Form B.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85880&attachNo=71610"},{"name":"1.2013-2014 쿠웨이트 정부초청 아랍어연수생 선발요강.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85880&attachNo=71632"},{"name":"4.서약서(본원 소정양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85880&attachNo=71639"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">쿠웨이트 정부에서는 2013 쿠웨이트정부초청 아랍어연수생 모집을 아래와 같이 실시하는 바, 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013 쿠웨이트정부초청 아랍어연수생 모집 요강</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;1. 선발 과정: 어학연수 과정</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;2. 선발 인원: 8명 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;3. 초청 기간: 1년 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 장학 혜택 (2012년 기준) </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 어학연수비 면제</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 숙식제공(기숙사내 숙식)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 왕복항공권 제공</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 소정의 생활비 (월 100KD, 약 40만원 상당)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 지원 자격</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;가. 대한민국 국적소지자로서 심신이 건강한 자 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 4.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 병역법 및 해외 유학에 결격 사유가 없는 자</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 품행이 방정하여 성실히 유학생활을 영위할 수 있는 자 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 고교성적 및 대학평점평균(GPA)이 우수한 자</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.3pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 아랍어(아랍학) 관련 학점을 15학점 이상 이수한 자 또는 아랍어(아랍학) 관련 (비)정규과정을 225시간 이상 이수한 자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">우선 선발</span></u></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 재학(졸업) 대학 총장의 추천을 받은 자 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;6. 선발 및 기타 사항: 붙임 참조 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt 3.2pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1.2013-2014 쿠웨이트정부초청 아랍어연수생 선발요강 &nbsp;1부</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 2.쿠웨이트 아랍어연수생 지원서 (본원 소정양식) 1부</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 3.Application Form B 1부</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 4.서약서(본원 소정양식) 1부</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 5.쿠웨이트정부어학지원자 DB 1부. &nbsp;끝. </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
